   "source": [
    "## Summary\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Attention** computes weighted sums of values based on query-key similarity\n",
    "- **Scaled dot-product attention** scales scores by $\\sqrt{d_k}$ for stable gradients\n",
    "- **Multi-head attention** runs multiple attention heads in parallel for diverse representations\n",
    "- **Positional encoding** adds sequence order information via sin/cos functions\n",
    "- **Transformer block** = MHA → Add&Norm → FFN → Add&Norm\n",
    "- **BERT** is an encoder-only model for understanding tasks\n",
    "- **GPT** is a decoder-only model for generation tasks\n",
    "- **Hugging Face** provides easy access to pre-trained models via `pipeline()` and `from_pretrained()`"
   ]
  }
